        "Read-only projections only. The separate command, support and moderation facets retain their own journeys; AI economics and #725 acceptance remain independent.",
        "The new browser tests exercise real ordinary/anonymous page 404, audit-role partition, no-match states, private canary absence, and no unsupported deployment controls. Provider configuration is not live-provider readiness.",
        "Accepted references cover shared entry and recovery framing only, not a curated task-body baseline. Current captured media and independent review remain required.",
